 libwebp7,
 libturbojpeg0 | libturbojpeg,
Description: minimal Xpra client written in C
 c-xpra connects to an Xpra server over TCP or a local socket and shows the
 windows of a seamless session on the local X11 display, forwarding pointer
 and keyboard input and ringing the bell. It has no other dependency than
 libX11.
 .
 It requires an Xpra 8.0 or later server.
